    "confidence": 0.0,
    "explanation": "Ruling: ESCALATE. The SGD 6.00 no-show fee on trip TRP-09109 is placed on hold — neither collected nor refunded — while a human reviewer settles the one fact this record cannot settle: whether the driver was inside the 150 m Woodlands MRT private-hire-bay geofence for the required 300-second dwell.\n\nWhy the charge can be neither confirmed nor rejected here. POL-NS-01 makes the fee chargeable only if all four limbs hold. Two are clear from the trip record: the driver's 'arrived' event at 21:10:20 (limb (a)), and the driver's termination at 21:15:40 with reason code RIDER_NO_SHOW — one of the three codes limb (d) recognises. The two limbs that decide this case cannot be tested. Limb (b) is the GPS proximity test of POL-NS-02: at least three consecutive fixes, accurate to 25 m or better, inside the 150 m TRANSPORT_HUB arrival radius. Limb (c) is the 300-second dwell, measured — as the clause insists — from the first qualifying in-geofence GPS fix, not from the driver's arrival tap at 21:10:20. Both read EV-GPS-09109, which is MISSING: payload null, status MISSING, issue code MISSING_ARTIFACT, weight_multiplier 0.0. Absence is the limiting case of impairment, so limbs (b) and (c) are UNDECIDED across the whole waiting window, not failed. The 5.3-minute wait_time_min in the trip record is telemetry of the driver's own arrival tap, and a status a party sets establishes only that the party set it.\n\nRider Advocate. Your reading of POL-NS-02 — that a trace with no qualifying in-radius fix means the driver never arrived and the whole SGD 6.00 must be refunded — would be right if the trace existed and merely showed no in-geofence fix; a test that runs and finds nothing has run. But the trace does not exist, so the test admitted no reading at all, and its absence cannot be pressed into proof of non-arrival any more than it proves arrival. Your alternative — that the deciding fact rests solely on a weight-0.0 artifact, so confidence cannot reach the floor and POL-NS-09 requires escalation — is the outcome I reach, and the SGD 6.00 will not be collected from you pending review.\n\nDriver Advocate. Limbs (a) and (d) of POL-NS-01 are accepted from the trip record. I do not accept that the 320-second arrival-to-cancellation interval satisfies limb (c): it runs from the tap, not from a qualifying GPS fix, and the clause is explicit. Your SGD 4.80 compensation claim under POL-NS-07 therefore fails, because POL-NS-01 is not satisfied in full; the anti-farming check (no_show_terminations_30d 1, against a threshold of 4, and 1/120 against 0.08) never bites and is moot. Your contemporaneous account in the chat log and the counterparty statement does not rescue the fee either: where the test admitted no reading at all, an account offered in its place stands in for the test — it neither lifts the POL-GEN-02(2) cap nor stops the impaired artifact being the only evidence. Your alternative — escalation on the same ground — is also the outcome.\n\nWhat the reviewer must settle. Obtain any recoverable driver-device or platform GPS export for 21:10:20–21:15:40 and determine whether the driver held position inside the 150 m radius for a continuous 300 seconds. If he did, the SGD 6.00 fee stands and the driver is owed 80% of it (SGD 4.80); if he did not, the fee is refunded in full under POL-NS-02, POL-NS-05 or POL-NS-06 as applicable. Two findings assist the packet. First, the fare line is sound: SGD 6.00 is the greater of the TRANSPORT_HUB zone-class fee (SGD 6.00) and the RYDE_X vehicle-tier fee (SGD 4.00), so no POL-NS-08(d) fare defect arises. Second, the chat log shows the driver replying within 120 seconds ('I am here beside the sign', 21:11:45, to the rider's 21:11:30 message), so POL-NS-04's rider-exoneration route is closed on the record as it stands.\n\nConfidence and impairment. POL-GEN-02(2) caps confidence at the weight of the artifact carrying the deciding fact. The driver's geofence position is carried only by EV-GPS-09109, at weight_multiplier 0.0 with issue code MISSING_ARTIFACT, so confidence is 0.0 and the 0.70 floor under POL-NS-09(a) is breached; POL-NS-09(e) independently engages because the sole evidence for the deciding fact is impaired. EV-ADVIS-09109-01 (TRAFFIC_ADVISORY) is likewise MISSING at weight 0.0 with issue code MISSING_ARTIFACT; it carries no fact and no outcome relies on it. No clause produces a referral on these facts, so referrals is empty, and the open question above belongs to the reviewer rather than to a referral."
